Package: bbghost
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, wireguard-tools, nftables, iproute2, curl, macchanger, python3, python3-tk
Recommends: tor, proxychains4, firefox-esr
Suggests: openvpn, gnupg
Maintainer: Black Bit <dev@blackbit.example>
Homepage: https://github.com/BlackBitGroup/BBGHOST
Description: OPSEC fail-closed toggle para o operador
 BBGHOST liga/desliga, num comando, uma cadeia de OPSEC fail-closed:
 VPN (WireGuard/OpenVPN, qualquer provedor) + kill switch (nftables) +
 DNS travado + Tor + MAC/hostname falsos. Se algo nao confirma que subiu,
 a rede continua travada e nunca vaza.
 .
 Inclui modo shell e uma interface grafica nativa (Tkinter), perfis de
 missao, multi-hop (VPN sobre VPN), isolamento estilo Whonix, verificacao
 de integridade e fail-closed no boot.
 .
 Ferramenta defensiva de protecao da propria identidade/conexao.
